{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "98fca84b-9f26-8351-ba8f-17ef080fb733",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T13:00:08-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nicholas Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:01-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:06-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Nick Fiore calling. I need a new recycling bin, mine's gone missing, I think. And I'm a renter, if that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:15-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, we can still get you one. Let me get the address. Where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:22-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "37 Broadway. North End, up past the little market."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:26-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "37 Broadway. Okay. And when you say missing, was it taken, or did it get damaged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:33-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I put it out Tuesday morning like always, and the trash got picked up but the recycling didn't. And then the bin's just not there anymore. Could've blown off, could've been grabbed, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:46-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the recycling was missed Tuesday. Was that the first time it was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:57:52-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's the second miss in a row. Two weeks now. Last time I figured the truck was running late, so I left it out and it still sat there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:58:03-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, two pickups in a row, the last two weeks, at 37 Broadway. I'll note that on the request so the supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:58:12-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate it. Sorry, hold on a second, there's a car pulling in. [pause] Okay, that's my son. He's learning to drive and we just got back from a lesson. He parked it about a foot from the bubbler, I mean the hose spigot, but fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:58:29-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, he made it back in one piece, that's what counts. Let me finish this up. Is it the standard size bin you had, the blue one with the lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:58:40-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, blue, with the lid. Regular size. Nothing fancy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:58:44-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. A blue replacement recycling bin with a lid, for 37 Broadway. They usually drop those off at the curb, so you may not need to be home. Should I put a number on the request in case they want to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:00-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:02-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173. Is that the landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:05-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, landline. I'm always here, or the machine picks up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:09-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So I have the replacement bin, the two missed recycling pickups, and the number. As for the missed recycling, I'm sending that to the crew lead today. Next pickup for your street should be the Tuesday coming up, so put the new bin out Monday night or early Tuesday once you have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:29-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if the bin doesn't come by then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:33-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should I just put the stuff out in a box or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:38-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a sturdy cardboard box is fine, or a plastic container, just mark it recycling so they know. Flatten any other boxes and set them alongside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:48-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can do that. Marker, I got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:52-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help you with today, Mr. Fiore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:56-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T12:59:59-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and tell your son to take it easy on the brakes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:00:06-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye now."
    }
  ],
